pageType: content
notes: |
  问题页：五个断裂点让个人投资者无法完成一次可信的期权研究。每个痛点都有可验证后果。
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: watermark
    elementType: text
    bounds: [770, 24, 130, 104]
    content:
      style: "$watermark"
      align: [right, top]
      text: "03"
  - elementId: kicker-tick
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 17, 14, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [82, 10, 460, 16]
    content:
      style: "$eyebrow"
      text: PROBLEM · 02
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 34, 840, 48]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: 五个断裂点，让个人投资者做不了一次可信的期权研究
  - elementId: subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 86, 840, 18]
    content:
      style: "$sub"
      text: 对标现状：Futu 手工流程 · 通用 LLM · 固定脚本
  - elementId: pain-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [60, 120, 560, 264]
    style: "$default"
    columnWidths: [0.42, 0.58]
    rowHeights: [0.09, 0.182, 0.182, 0.182, 0.182, 0.182]
    rows:
      - - text: 断裂点
        - text: 后果
      - - text: 行情、规则、账户分散在多页面
        - text: 研究靠手工拼接，易漏规格与费用
      - - text: 理论价被当成成交价
        - text: 忽略 bid/ask、滑点与 tick，盈亏边界失真
      - - text: 港美股规则差异大
        - text: 美式/欧式、实物/现金交割混用模板
      - - text: 通用 LLM 会编造数字
        - text: 无法承担账户风控与交易权限判断
      - - text: 结论没有审计
        - text: 错后无法复盘，也无法向他人复核
  - elementId: result-plate
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [640, 120, 260, 112]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$panel"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: result-rail
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [640, 120, 4, 112]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$down"}
  - elementId: result-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 132, 220, 16]
    content:
      style: "$cap"
      bold: true
      color: "$down"
      text: 结果
  - elementId: result-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 154, 220, 60]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: |
        <p>要么不敢决策，</p>
        <p>要么在错误口径上决策。</p>
  - elementId: quote-plate
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [640, 244, 260, 140]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primaryA"}
  - elementId: quote-rail
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [640, 244, 4, 140]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: quote-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 256, 40, 12]
    content:
      style: "$cap"
      bold: true
      color: "$primary"
      text: 金句
  - elementId: quote-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 276, 220, 60]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 12
      bold: true
      text: 不解决可信问题，再多工具也只是更快地犯错。
  - elementId: gap-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 344, 220, 40]
    content:
      style: "$cap"
      text: 研究缺口：一条让数字可信、结论可拒绝的完整期权研究闭环。
  - elementId: takeaway
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 438, 840, 54]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$deep"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: takeaway-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 452, 804, 28]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 11
      text: 问题本质不是缺工具，而是缺一条「数字可信、结论可拒绝」的完整链路。
  - elementId: footer-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [60, 518, 840, 1]
    viewBox: [840, 1]
    points: "0,0 840,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 520, 600, 14]
    content:
      style: "$cap"
      text: 来源：docs/PRD.md §1.2 当前痛点
  - elementId: footer-right
    elementType: text
    bounds: [700, 520, 200, 14]
    content:
      style: "$cap"
      align: [right, top]
      text: 03 / 16
animations:
  - elementId: pain-table
    effect: fade-in
    trigger: onClick
    durationMs: 450
    easing: ease-out
  - elementId: result-plate
    effect: fade-in
    trigger: withPrevious
    durationMs: 350
  - elementId: result-rail
    effect: fade-in
    trigger: withPrevious
    durationMs: 250
  - elementId: result-label
    effect: fade-in
    trigger: withPrevious
    durationMs: 250
  - elementId: result-text
    effect: fade-in
    trigger: withPrevious
    durationMs: 300
  - elementId: quote-plate
    effect: fade-in
    trigger: onClick
    durationMs: 400
  - elementId: quote-rail
    effect: fade-in
    trigger: withPrevious
    durationMs: 250
  - elementId: quote-label
    effect: fade-in
    trigger: withPrevious
    durationMs: 250
  - elementId: quote-text
    effect: fade-in
    trigger: withPrevious
    durationMs: 300
  - elementId: gap-note
    effect: fade-in
    trigger: withPrevious
    durationMs: 300
  - elementId: takeaway
    effect: fade-in
    trigger: onClick
    durationMs: 400
  - elementId: takeaway-text
    effect: fade-in
    trigger: withPrevious
    durationMs: 300
